      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "They weren\\'t very good on communications. I had to ring them constantly to find out how my application was progressing, who would be doing the installation, when the panels would be delivered. I even nominated for their \\\"We\\'ll do it on a weekend to speed things up\\\", but they never acknowledged that.\\r\\n\\r\\nI have to give them top marks for service. The first inverter failed within a week, and the second about a month later. Both were replaced without any quibbling or cost (including labor!!). Seeing BBE had to organise a replacement, ship it fromto South Australia, and get the Subbie to do the replacement in less than a week (both times) is very impressive.",
