      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "hi all ... we had fantastic service all our needs were met, the install was fast and all the information i needed was supplied. all paper  work was handled by the suplier so no need for me to chase anything up. the system is working exteremly well, coupled with solar hot water and its good bye to the price rises expected. every one in australia should consider solar its the logical choice to save money and stick it to the power suppliers,, cheers",
